  `progress.log`.
- **Learnings for future iterations:**
  - In aspect-ratio mode, use the larger minimum scale required by either
    axis; clamping width and height independently would distort the image.
  - Reflected string attributes can remain the source of truth while typed
    numeric accessors normalize missing or invalid values at read time.
